	(text "This board implements the I/O for either a Commodore PET, a \nCommodore B-Series, or the Ulti-PET using a single FPGA.\n\nThe I/O can be addressed/used via the CS/A Bus and the /IOSEL\nsignal (if activated at the right address for the specific\nmodel)"
